      "mergeID": "62f5ed38cd4f5b44b3051205",
      "mergedPostDetails": "This is a feature I would really like to have implemented. When a person joins an instance, a notification would pop up on the screen saying something along the lines of \"Player (username) has joined the instance\". Here is what I would like the settings for it to have:\n- position-able and moveable on the screen\n- adjustable transparency\n- time setting for how long the notification appears on screen\n- color the player name to a custom color\n- works in BOTH VR and desktop mode",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Add a player join notification",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5dd0b8fdc372ee678614d062",
